        "content": "There are reports of raiders on the east road and fighting beyond the forest. If you are awake at night, go to the watchpost or the east road to keep an eye out for any movement. Stay alert and report any suspicious activity to the village. [!go(to=east_road)] [!work(site=watchpost, ticks=8)]"
