        "content": "There is fighting and raiders on the road beyond the forest. It is too dangerous to travel that way. Avoid the forest edge and the east road until the danger passes. [!avoid(place=forest_edge, ticks=12)] [!avoid(place=east_road, ticks=12)]"
      },
      {
