        "became": "apprentice",
        "content": "There are reports of raiders and fighting on the east road. The danger is close to the fields. Avoid the east road until the threat passes, and warn anyone you meet about the danger. [!avoid(place=east_road, ticks=20)] [!warn(target=nearby, topic=raiders and fighting on the east road)]"
      },
      {
        "id": "learned-elin-1",
