        "candidate": 221,
        "author": "elin",
        "became": "apprentice",
        "content": "The night is dark and the day is done. If you are still out at the schoolyard, it is time to go home and rest. Do not linger in the dark; the roads are unsafe and the cold sets in. [!go(to=home)] [!rest(until=morning)]"
      },
