        "id": "learned-frida-1",
        "n": 28,
        "candidate": 58,
        "author": "frida",
        "became": "apprentice",
        "content": "The grain at the mill is spoiled and the frost has taken the fields. The village is gathered at the well, but the water is turned and making people ill. Do not drink from it. Go to the mill to inspect the stores and warn the neighbors about the sickness spreading through the houses. [!go(to=mill)] [!warn(target=nearby, topic=well water is sick and grain is bad)]"
      }
